OL,3,GNEWSA'Dark and dingy' mental health hub
OL,4,Agets #680k refurb
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mental health hub based in a 1920s
OL,7,Fbuilding in Kent has re-opened after a
OL,8,F#680,000 refurbishment which saw it
OL,9,Fclosed for half a year.
OL,11,FColeman House in Dover has been
OL,12,Fredecorated, with new windows and
OL,13,Fflooring fitted to improve conditions
OL,14,Ffor patients and staff.
OL,16,FSharon Bean, a nurse prescriber at
OL,17,FColeman House, said the building was
OL,18,F"dark, dingy, cold, damp and smelly"
OL,19,Fbefore.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
