OL,3,GNEWSA'Dark and dingy' mental health hub
OL,4,Agets #680k refurb
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Windows were rotting or wouldn't open
OL,7,Fand now it's light, friendly, welcoming
OL,8,Fand warm," she said. "The more that we
OL,9,Fcan encourage people to talk and open
OL,10,Fup, the better their recovery is likely
OL,11,Fto be. "
